  "content": "<div><h1>FPS 疊加層</h1><h3>簡單輕量的效能監控工具</h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffps-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fps-overlay?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=00AF5C&amp;label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/1341801\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1341801?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=D15B40&amp;label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffps-overlay%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/fps-overlay?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=orange&amp;label=Latest Ver\" alt=\"版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Source_Code-6e5494?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub 原始碼\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=blue&amp;cacheSeconds=1\" alt=\"授權\"></a></div><hr><div><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tlJUHTnhtV8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>曾在 AsianHalfSquat 影片中登場！v3.6 <strong>舊版</strong></h2><p>在<strong>「Voxy vs Distant Horizons」</strong>展示影片中亮相。使用內建預設主題即可獲得同樣的專業風格！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/98cefb6ba826b3c2472c30824371712a9793e8b7.jpeg\" alt=\"AsianHalfSquat 特色\"></p><hr><h2>功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>即時數據顯示：</strong>即時追蹤 FPS、平均 FPS、延遲與記憶體使用量。</li>\n<li><strong>完全自訂：</strong>透過設定選單輕鬆調整<strong>大小、位置與顏色</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>快速切換：</strong>按單一按鍵即可隱藏或顯示疊加層。<strong>（預設按鍵：<code>o</code>）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>極度輕量：</strong>專為效能最佳化撰寫，不影響遊戲幀數。</li>\n<li><strong>跨平台支援：</strong>完整支援 <strong>Fabric</strong>、<strong>NeoForge</strong> 與 <strong>Forge</strong>。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>安裝與設定</h2><h3>如何安裝</h3><ol>\n<li>下載並安裝你偏好的載入器（<strong>Fabric</strong> 或 <strong>NeoForge</strong>）。</li>\n<li>下載適用於你的 Minecraft 版本的 <strong>FPS Overlay</strong> jar 檔案。</li>\n<li>將檔案放入你的 <code>.minecraft/mods</code> 資料夾。</li>\n<li>啟動遊戲即可開始使用！</li>\n</ol><h3>如何切換模式</h3><ol>\n<li>開啟設定選單（Fabric 環境下可使用 <strong>Mod Menu</strong>）。</li>\n<li>找到<strong>版面類型</strong>設定。</li>\n<li>在<strong>預設</strong>、<strong>導航列</strong>或 <strong>AsianHalfSquat</strong> 風格之間切換。</li>\n</ol>",
